// nothing else copied): a sound sticker's WebP must carry "sound-sha256"
// (the SHA-256 of its audio, hex) in its EXIF — the receiving client pairs
// sticker and sound by that hash. The payload is the WhatsApp sticker EXIF
// shape: a little-endian TIFF header with a single IFD entry (tag 0x5741,
// type undefined) whose value is a JSON document, stored in the WebP 'EXIF'
